# Professional License Registry - the repository's one .gitignore.
#
# Every rule that used to live in a .gitignore further down, rewritten
# relative to the root with its meaning unchanged: a bare name (node_modules,
# *.log) matched at any depth under that directory and is now "dir/**/name";
# an anchored pattern (/Pods/, dist/test) is now "dir/...". Add new rules here,
# in the section of the directory they are for.

# Local environment files may contain credentials and machine-specific URLs.
# Ignore every populated dotenv variant first. The leading `!` in the final
# rule is Git's explicit UNIGNORE syntax: `.env.example` templates stay tracked.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# macOS directory metadata, at any depth.
.DS_Store

# Raw local migration command output; retain the summarized validation reports.

# --- Besu QBFT network --------------------------------------------------------
# The validators' chain state. The node keys they run with are in
# networkFiles/keys and stay tracked; this is what the nodes write.
infra/besu/besu-qbft-network/data/

